.\" Distro-authored man page for the Fedora pidp8i package.
.\" Candidate for upstreaming to the PiDP-8/I project.
.TH PIDP8I-SIM-ILS 1 "November 21, 2026" "PiDP-8/I" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pidp8i-sim-ils \- PiDP-8/I simulator with the lamp simulator forced on
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pidp8i-sim-ils
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B pidp8i-sim-ils
is a hard link to
.BR pidp8i-sim (1)
that forces ILS mode: the incandescent lamp simulator is enabled
regardless of the build configuration, driving the panel LEDs so they
mimic the glow and decay of the original incandescent bulbs.
Everything else, including the requirement for real GPIO panel
hardware, is as described in
.BR pidp8i-sim (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pidp8i-sim (1),
.BR pidp8i (1)
